OL,3,GNEWSATrial by NHS trust reduces
OL,4,Ainpatient dementia beds
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn NHS trust is investigating whether
OL,7,Fit should permanently reduce the number
OL,8,Fof bedspaces it provides to dementia
OL,9,Fpatients, ahead of a planned long-term
OL,10,Freview of its services.
OL,12,FCumbria, Northumberland, Tyne and Wear
OL,13,FNHS Foundation Trust previously
OL,14,Fprovided 34 inpatient beds to dementia
OL,15,Fand Alzheimer's disease patients across
OL,16,FSunderland and Northumberland.
OL,23,APub: 04-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NE Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,396,390,260,160,0,100
PN,39502
