OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F395A1788503197
OL,1,W5j 5Q7kjs1 wsj#57sj  w{j#57i
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,$ -,* %-.*,$%** %-& (,,,
OL,3,GNEWSATrial by NHS trust reduces
OL,4,Ainpatient dementia beds
OL,5,
OL,6,FIt is now trialling whether 21 beds are
OL,7,Fenough for the two areas, which it said
OL,8,Freflected current demand. A
OL,9,Fspokesperson said bedspaces would be
OL,10,Fincreased up to 34 again during the
OL,11,Ftrial, if required.
OL,13,FThe move is ahead of a long-term review
OL,14,Fof services for the patients, which may
OL,15,Finvolve closing its Northumberland ward
OL,16,Ffully.
